#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:6
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"We provide a 5-minutes quick start video (on Mac OS) that can be accessed"
" here `https://youtu.be/6czcxC90gp0 <https://youtu.be/6czcxC90gp0>`_."
msgstr ""
"我们提供了一个在Mac OS系统下如何开始使用 |foam| 的视频教程， 链接为：\\ "
"`腾讯视频: https://v.qq.com/x/page/p09599iy5yt.html <https://v.qq.com/x/page/p09599iy5yt.html>`_."


#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"There are two ways to install |foam|. The easiest way is intalling via "
"Docker image, see :numref:`sec:install_docker`. Another way is building "
"from source code if user has experience of OpenFOAM installation, see "
"section of `Build from source`_."
msgstr ""
"有两种方式安装\\ |foam|. 最快捷最容易的方式是通过Docker镜像, 见\\ :numref:`sec:install_docker` "
"；另一种方式是通过编译源码进行安装 对于有使用OpenFOAM经验的用户推荐这种方式, 见\\ `Build from source`_."

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:23
msgid "Docker image"
msgstr "Docker镜像"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:24
msgid ""
"In order to quick start to use |foam| for non-Ubuntu users, we provided a"
" pre-compiled docker image which can be found on `Docker Hub "
"<https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/zguo/hydrothermalfoam>`_ "
"repository, named `zguo/hydrothermalfoam "
"<https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/zguo/hydrothermalfoam>`_. It's "
"pretty simple to install |foam| via Docker, all the steps are summarized "
"below,"
msgstr ""
"为了让非Ubuntu用户快速入门使用\\ |foam|, 我们提供了一个 预编译的docker镜像，可以在\\ `Docker Hub "
"<https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/zguo/hydrothermalfoam>`_\\ "
"仓库中下载, 其名字为\\ `zguo/hydrothermalfoam "
"<https://hub.docker.com/repository/docker/zguo/hydrothermalfoam>`_ 。 "
"通过Docker安装 |foam| 非常容易, 所有的步骤总结如下,"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Install** `Docker desktop <https://www.docker.com/products/docker-"
"desktop>`_ and keep it running."
msgstr ""
"**安装**\\ `Docker桌面应用程序 <https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop>`_"
" 并保持其为运行状态."

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Pull** the docker image of |foam| by running command of :code:`docker "
"pull zguo/hydrothermalfoam`."
msgstr ""
"**拉取**\\ |foam|\\ 的Docker镜像，可使用命令：\\ :code:`docker pull "
"zguo/hydrothermalfoam`."

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Install a container** from the docker image by running shell script "
"which can be fond in source code directory of `docker "
"<https://gitlab.com/gmdpapers/hydrothermalfoam/-/tree/master/docker>`_ "
"(see also :numref:`lst_docker_mac` and :numref:`lst_docker_win`). The "
":code:`HydrothermalFoam_runs` directory is a shared folder between the "
"container and host machine."
msgstr ""
"用上一步拉取的镜像 **安装一个容器** ，可以运行一段shell脚本来完成。shell脚本文件可以在源代码的\\ `docker "
"<https://gitlab.com/gmdpapers/hydrothermalfoam/-/tree/master/docker>`_ "
"路径中找到(也可之间参考 :numref:`lst_docker_mac` 和 :numref:`lst_docker_win`)。其中 "
":code:`HydrothermalFoam_runs`\\目录是容器和主机之间的共享目录。"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:35
msgid ""
"Script for Mac OS (`installMacHydrothermalFoam.sh "
"<https://gitlab.com/gmdpapers/hydrothermalfoam/-/blob/master/docker/installMacHydrothermalFoam.sh>`_)"
msgstr ""
"Mac OS系统下的安装Docker容器的脚本 (`installMacHydrothermalFoam.sh "
"<https://gitlab.com/gmdpapers/hydrothermalfoam/-/blob/master/docker/installMacHydrothermalFoam.sh>`_)"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:43
msgid ""
"Script for Windows (`installWindowsHydrothermalFoam.ps1 "
"<https://gitlab.com/gmdpapers/hydrothermalfoam/-/blob/master/docker/installWindowsHydrothermalFoam.ps1>`_)"
msgstr ""
"Windows系统下的Power Shell脚本 (`installWindowsHydrothermalFoam.ps1 "
"<https://gitlab.com/gmdpapers/hydrothermalfoam/-/blob/master/docker/installWindowsHydrothermalFoam.ps1>`_)"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Start the container** by running command of :code:`docker start "
"hydrothermalfoam`."
msgstr "**开始运行容器**：运行命令\\ :code:`docker start hydrothermalfoam`。"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Attach the container** by running command of :code:`docker attach "
"hydrothermalfoam`."
msgstr "**进入容器**：运行命令\\ :code:`docker attach hydrothermalfoam`。"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:55
msgid ""
"The user now in a Ubuntu linux environment with precompiled "
"HydrothermalFoam tools which located at directory of "
":code:`~/HydrothermalFoam`. We recommend user run HydrothermalFoam cases "
"in the directory of :code:`HydrothermalFoam_runs` in the container, and "
"then the results are synchronized in the shared directory in the host, "
"and thus can be visualized by ParaView_, Tecplot_ or other CFD post-"
"processing software."
msgstr ""
"通过上面的几个步骤，用户现在已经进入了HydrothermalFoam的Docker镜像所创建的容器中，这个环境其实就跟Ubuntu系统没什么区别。用户可以暂且认为自己是在一个Ubuntu"
" linux子系统中。HydrothermalFoam的所有文件所在目录为\\ :code:`~/HydrothermalFoam`。 "
"我们建议用户在\\ "
":code:`HydrothermalFoam_runs`\\目录中运行HydrothermalFoam的算例。如此以来，在Docker容器中运行的算例结果会通过共享目录同步到主机中，即可以在主机中访问这些运算结果。也就是说，用户可以在主机的共享目录中用\\"
" ParaView_, Tecplot_ 或者其他的CFD后处理软件进行结果可视化或进一步分析。"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:62
msgid "Build from source"
msgstr "从源码编译"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:65
msgid "Install OpenFOAM"
msgstr "安装OpenFOAM"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:67
msgid ""
"The |foam| v1.0 is developed based on OpenFOAM-7, which can be installed "
"according to the installation instructions "
"(https://openfoam.org/download/) given by the development team for "
"`Ubuntu Linux <https://openfoam.org/download/7-ubuntu/>`_, `Other Linux "
"<https://openfoam.org/download/7-linux/>`_, `macOS "
"<https://openfoam.org/download/7-macos/>`_ and `Windows "
"<https://openfoam.org/download/windows-10/>`_ platform, respectively."
msgstr ""
"因为\\ |foam| v1.0 是基于OpenFOAM-7开发的, 而OpenFOAM可以通过其官方网站的安装步骤 "
"(https://openfoam.org/download/) 进行安装。涵盖\\ `Ubuntu Linux "
"<https://openfoam.org/download/7-ubuntu/>`_, `Other Linux "
"<https://openfoam.org/download/7-linux/>`_, `macOS "
"<https://openfoam.org/download/7-macos/>`_\\ 和\\ `Windows "
"<https://openfoam.org/download/windows-10/>`_\\ 平台"

