"所示，然后可以根据如下的三个步骤进行编译："

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:86
msgid "Structure and components of the |foam| toolbox."
msgstr "|foam|\\ 的文件结构示意图。"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:90
msgid ""
"The following steps are only proper for Mac OS and Linux systems, we do "
"not yet build HydrothermalFoam on Windows system directly. If users using"
" ubuntu sub-system on Windows 10, the following steps could work in the "
"sub-system."
msgstr ""
"下列的步骤只适用于Mac OS或Linux系统, "
"我们并没有提供在Windows系统下的编译HydrothermalFoam的方式，比如用Visual "
"Studio之类的。如果用户当前的系统是Windows "
"10则可以通过开启Ubuntu子系统后，在子系统下编译HydrothermalFoam，下列的步骤可能可以达到目的。"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:95
msgid ""
"**Build freesteam-2.1 library**. The freesteam project is constructed by "
"scons_, which is a open source software constructiontool dependent on "
"`python 2`_, and based on GSL_ (GNUScientificLibrary). Therefore python "
"2, scons and GSL have to be installed firstly, then change directory to "
"freesteam-2.1 in HydrothermalFoam source code and type command of "
":code:`scons INSTALL_PREFIX=$FOAM_USER_LIBBIN install` to compile "
"freesteam library named :code:`libfreesteam.so`. See home page of "
"freesteam-2.1_ project for more details."
msgstr ""
"**编译freesteam-2.1动态库**： freesteam项目是用\\ scons_\\ （一个类似于cmake的工具）构建的，依赖于\\"
" `python 2`_\\ 。而且freesteam中的算法用到了\\ GSL_ (GNU Scientific "
"Library)。因此必须首先安装python 2、scons和GSL库。然后进入源代码中的freesteam-2.1目录，运行命令：\\ "
":code:`scons INSTALL_PREFIX=$FOAM_USER_LIBBIN install`\\ "
"编译freesteam动态库，编译成功后会生成名为\\ :code:`libfreesteam.so`\\ "
"的动态库文件。关于更多编译freesteam的细节可以参考其官方主页中的说明：freesteam-2.1_\\ 。"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:97
msgid ""
"**Build libraries of customized boundary conditions and thermo-physical "
"model**. Change directory to libraries and type command of "
":code:`./Allmake` to compile the libraries named "
":code:`libHydroThermoPhysicalModels.so, "
"libHydrothermalBoundaryConditions.so`."
msgstr ""
"**编译自定义边界条件和热物理模型库**： 进入源代码中的libraries目录， 然后运行命令\\ :code:`./Allmake`\\ "
"编译相应的动态库，最后会生成名为\\ :code:`libHydroThermoPhysicalModels.so, "
"libHydrothermalBoundaryConditions.so`\\ 的动态库文件。位于\\ "
":code:`$FOAM_USER_LIBBIN`\\ 目录中。"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:101
msgid ""
"It should be noted that if you are using OpenFOAM-8, you have to run "
"`./Allmake-8` to compile thermo-physical model to compatible with "
"OpenFOAM-8. And of course the `Allmake` script is designed for "
"OpenFOAM-7. **This is the only difference between version 7 and version "
"8.**"
msgstr ""
"需要注意的是，如果你用的是OpenFOAM-8版本，则需要在这里运行 "
"`./Allmake-8` 脚本编译与OpenFOAM-8兼容的热物理模型."
"当然了， `Allmake` 脚本是用于编译与OpenFOAM-7版本对应的热物理模型。 "
"**这也是HydrothermalFoam在OpenFOAM-7与OpenFOAM-8版本之间的唯一区别 "
"。**"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:103
msgid ""
"**Build solver of HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam**. Change directory to"
" HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam and type command of :code:`wmake` to "
"compile the solver named :code:`HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam`."
msgstr ""
"**编译求解器HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam**：切换目录到solvers/HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam目录中，然后运行命令\\"
" :code:`wmake`\\ 进行编译，最后会生成一个名为\\ "
":code:`HydrothermalSinglePhaseDarcyFoam`\\ 可执行文件，即为求解器应用程序。位于\\ "
":code:`$FOAM_USER_APPBIN`\\ 目录中。"

#: ../../source/Installation/index.rst:107
msgid ""
"All the library files and executable application (solver) file will be "
"generated in directories defined by OpenFOAM’s path variables of "
":code:`FOAM_USER_LIBBIN` and :code:`FOAM_USER_APPBIN`, respectively. If "
"build HydrothermalFoam in Mac OS, the extension of the library files is "
":code:`.dylib`, please make a symbolic links. For example, see following "
"command for :code:`libHydroThermoPhysicalModels.dylib`"
msgstr ""
"所有的OpenFOAM相关的动态库和可执行文件都分别保存在目录\\ :code:`FOAM_USER_LIBBIN`\\ 和\\ "
":code:`FOAM_USER_APPBIN`\\ 中。Mac OS系统中的动态库文件的后缀名是\\ :code:`.dylib`\\ "
"，可以使用\\ :code:`ln`\\ 命令创建一个软连接为.so的动态库文件，这样可以保持多平台的动态库调用时候的文件名一致性。"

